 "_comment": "Graham's Hole line pools (CP2). Professional presenter language; humour from the mismatch. Insertion slots: {name} {count} {answer} {points}.",
 "items": [
  {
   "id": "g.hole_intro.1",
   "category": "hole_intro",
   "text": "Our first game tonight. It's called Hole. I didn't name it.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_intro.2",
   "category": "hole_intro",
   "text": "Time for Hole. A simple game. Some of you will still struggle.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_intro.3",
   "category": "hole_intro",
   "text": "Hole. The game where we show you an opening and you tell us what it belongs to.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_rules.1",
   "category": "hole_rules",
   "text": "We start very close. Lock in early and it's worth fifteen hundred. Wait, and it's worth less. Once you've locked, you've locked.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_rules.2",
   "category": "hole_rules",
   "text": "The closer the look when you lock in, the more it's worth. Fifteen hundred at first glance, five hundred if you need it spelled out.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_rules.3",
   "category": "hole_rules",
   "text": "Lock in on your unit whenever you're sure. You can't change your mind. This isn't a democracy.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_round_start.1",
   "category": "hole_round_start",
   "text": "Hole number {count}. Have a good look.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_round_start.2",
   "category": "hole_round_start",
   "text": "Here's your first look.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_round_start.3",
   "category": "hole_round_start",
   "text": "Next hole.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_round_start.4",
   "category": "hole_round_start",
   "text": "Right. What's this?",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_round_start.5",
   "category": "hole_round_start",
   "text": "Look closely. Not too closely.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_stage_more.1",
   "category": "hole_stage_more",
   "text": "Pulling back a little. Now worth {points}.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_stage_more.2",
   "category": "hole_stage_more",
   "text": "A bit more for you.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_stage_more.3",
   "category": "hole_stage_more",
   "text": "Wider. If that helps.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_stage_more.4",
   "category": "hole_stage_more",
   "text": "Camera two, pull out. Gently.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_last_look.1",
   "category": "hole_last_look",
   "text": "Last look. Lock in now or forever hold your peace.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_last_look.2",
   "category": "hole_last_look",
   "text": "That's as much as you're getting.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_safety_net.1",
   "category": "hole_safety_net",
   "text": "For those still dithering, multiple choice. Five hundred points.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_safety_net.2",
   "category": "hole_safety_net",
   "text": "Here are some options, for the cowards.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_safety_net.3",
   "category": "hole_safety_net",
   "text": "Multiple choice. No shame in it. Some shame in it.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_early_lock.1",
   "category": "hole_early_lock",
   "text": "{name} has locked in already. On that?",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_early_lock.2",
   "category": "hole_early_lock",
   "text": "{name}'s committed. Bold.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_early_lock.3",
   "category": "hole_early_lock",
   "text": "And {name} is in. From a smudge.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_reveal.1",
   "category": "hole_reveal",
   "text": "It's {answer}.",
