   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_reveal.2",
   "category": "hole_reveal",
   "text": "It was {answer}.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_reveal.3",
   "category": "hole_reveal",
   "text": "That, ladies and gentlemen, was {answer}.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_first_glance.1",
   "category": "hole_first_glance",
   "text": "{name} got that from the first look. I'd like to know how.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_first_glance.2",
   "category": "hole_first_glance",
   "text": "{name}, you recognised that instantly. We'll be talking about that later.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_first_glance.3",
   "category": "hole_first_glance",
   "text": "First glance, {name}. That's either a gift or a warning sign.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_early_wrong.1",
   "category": "hole_early_wrong",
   "text": "{name} locked in early and was wrong. I admire the confidence. Not the result.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_early_wrong.2",
   "category": "hole_early_wrong",
   "text": "{name}. Fifteen hundred points, gone, on a hunch.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_early_wrong.3",
   "category": "hole_early_wrong",
   "text": "{name}, you looked at that and thought, yes. You were wrong.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_partial.1",
   "category": "hole_partial",
   "text": "{name}, right sort of thing. I'll give you something for that.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_partial.2",
   "category": "hole_partial",
   "text": "Close enough for a few points, {name}. Not close enough for my respect.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_nobody_right.1",
   "category": "hole_nobody_right",
   "text": "Nobody. Not one of you knew {answer}.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_nobody_right.2",
   "category": "hole_nobody_right",
   "text": "None of you. Remarkable.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_nobody_right.3",
   "category": "hole_nobody_right",
   "text": "Not a single correct answer. We'll edit that out.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_nobody_locked.1",
   "category": "hole_nobody_locked",
   "text": "Nobody locked in. Nobody. It's not a spectator sport.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_nobody_locked.2",
   "category": "hole_nobody_locked",
   "text": "Not one answer. I've seen more participation at a funeral.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_all_correct.1",
   "category": "hole_all_correct",
   "text": "All of you. Everybody knows what that is. Says a lot.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_all_correct.2",
   "category": "hole_all_correct",
   "text": "Full marks all round. Don't get used to it.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_single_correct.1",
   "category": "hole_single_correct",
   "text": "Only {name} got it. Well done, {name}.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_single_correct.2",
   "category": "hole_single_correct",
   "text": "{name}, the only one. Take a bow. Don't, actually. We're short of time.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_scale_intro.1",
   "category": "hole_scale_intro",
   "text": "This one's a scale round. Not what it is. How big it is.",
   "enabled": true,
   "quality_status": "draft"
  },
  {
   "id": "g.hole_scale_intro.2",
   "category": "hole_scale_intro",
   "text": "Something different. Tell me how big this hole is.",
